    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Works as std::vector, except it cannot grow its capacity and the memory is taken from an <ref refid="classmemt_1_1_arena" kindref="compound">Arena</ref>.</para>
<para>Only frees its memory on destruction if FreeMemory is true. In that case that memory must be the top allocation on the <ref refid="classmemt_1_1_arena" kindref="compound">Arena</ref>.</para>
<para>Always calls the destructors of contained entries even when FreeMemory is false. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
